      "content": "i get that... but it doesn't feel like love. it feels like i'm just an error in the system. like the universe made a mistake and left me here by accident instead of them. sometimes i look at my life and it just feels so unnecessary, you know? like i'm just consuming resources and space that they deserved way more than i do.",
